\ tests/diff.fam — test-only: src/diff.fam against the Rust node's `asert` and
\ `work_for_target` (vectors printed by a test run of it), on both networks.

: dtv variable ;   : dt ( -- a )   dtv 40 lit lazy ;    \ result, expected

\ dt= ( w0 .. w7 -- flag )   whether the result (dt) is the 32 bytes whose
\        little-endian words these are.
: dt= ( w0 .. w7 -- flag )
	8 lit 0 lit do dt 20 lit + 1C lit i 2 lit lshift - + ! loop
	dt dt 20 lit + 8 lit ceq
;

